Adventurer,

The *Wild Blood* ( https://albiononline.com/update/wild-blood ) update is c=
oming soon, and in anticipation of its release we=E2=80=99re taking a close=
r look at some of its features in a series of *Dev Talks*.

*Awakened Weapons* are a major new addition to Albion=E2=80=99s sandbox wor=
ld, giving players the chance to add unique items which live on in the game=
. Watch here:

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DghbzjoR3sZc )

Or click *here* ( https://albiononline.com/news/dev-talk-awakened-weapons )=
 for a written summary.

Islands and Farming Improvements
--------------------------------

*Islands and Farming* are getting a rework with Wild Blood, with gorgeous n=
ew graphics for each island biome and new bonuses for Farming that will add=
 depth to Albion=E2=80=99s economy.

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DY98B0IIA4xw )

Read a summary *here* ( https://albiononline.com/news/dev-talk-islands-farm=
ing ).

Island Move Available
---------------------

Until the release of Wild Blood on October 16, you can *move your islands o=
nce* ( https://albiononline.com/news/island-move-2023 ) , to choose which b=
iome and which bonuses you want to enjoy. For more on this, click here:

